  "description": "Ladis Tillord is the eldest daughter of a faded knightly house clinging to its legendary name. Her sword restored her house’s honor, only for every victory it won to be claimed by her incompetent brother—for the sake of family. Only at death’s door did she realize the ties she clung to had only held her back. Given a second life, Ladis will no longer let blood and duty decide her fate. But after a lifetime of living for others, can she finally choose herself and carve her own path to peace? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
